"nothing to read.\n"
"Most likely this is a bug in the ALSA driver '%s'. Please report this issue "
"to the ALSA developers.\n"
"We were woken up with POLLIN set -- however a subsequent snd_pcm_avail() "
"returned 0 or another value < min_avail."
msgstr ""

